Vendored from https://github.com/pq-crystals/dilithium (directory ref/) at commit
d35ba3fe5449bee3e6d43e1f296c3ca818bd36be (2026-06-03), the FIPS 204 standard branch.

Local changes, each marked with an 'Xyntetik' comment in sign.c and sign.h:
  1. key generation takes a caller-supplied 32-byte seed (crypto_sign_keypair_seed);
     no OS random source is consulted.
  2. randomized (hedged) signing is compiled out; signing is deterministic.
config.h pins DILITHIUM_MODE 2 (ML-DSA-44).

